A_232 - When you're on social networks, other people may develop feelings or desires for you. Be aware that your thoughts may change. This is the other side of social networks. Be careful about notifications and an always-on internet connection, too. Personally, I prefer to disable wireless on my smartphone and stop the notification "pinball." This may have been true in the past, but many once-popular social networks have become marginalized and less used than they once were.